Z||000008||Old Lar||04-09-2001||07:27 PM||||I think that there were only 65 made at $50,000 + when new. I stand corrected, the Zimmer web site below says 170 were built)  I have seen only photos of the red.  I think that there was a red one on the market last year for $20,000.  The web site lists prices for the Quicksilver of up to 26K in good shape.<P>Individual taste for the car, I like it, it is different.  (The Quicksilver Zimmer looks a lot better than the pimpmobiles they are selling today). Just think of the versatility of the space age Fiero frame.  Bob Steiger has a white one stuffed into one of his bays.<p>[This message has been edited by Old Lar (edited 04-09-2001).]||||reg||1
